    "detailed_description": "Castle Conquest is a real-time strategy game with simple rules, in which you need to capture all the fortresses on the map. Build up your forces in your castles, and then send units to attack your opponents' fortresses. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game you will be able to:<br />\r\n1.\tManage armies for defense and conquest.<br />\r\n2.\tConstruct buildings in castles to increase warrior training speed, income, defense and other features.<br />\r\n3.\tUse special strategic tricks to gain an advantage.<br />\r\n4.\tComplete 108 unique levels and 3 war campaigns. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n1.\tSimple mechanics that are easy to understand.<br />\r\n2.\tCustomizable difficulty level. On high levels you will have to think through every action.<br />\r\n3. Active pause, during which you can give orders.<br />\r\n4.\tOne-on-one battles with your opponent, as well as two, three and four at once, in the &quot;every man for himself&quot; mode.",
